\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The training progression for \texttt  {spree} (seed 123). Arrows trace every episode that set a new best-so-far ADP reduction, left to right across the top row and then right to left across the bottom row. Each panel is a real VPR placement: saturated tiles are occupied, pale tiles are provisioned but unused. Early episodes, still close to random exploration, overshoot badly in both fabric size and ADP. Later episodes converge on a compact, exactly-sized fabric (bottom left).}}{5}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:layout}{{3}{5}{The training progression for \texttt {spree} (seed 123). Arrows trace every episode that set a new best-so-far ADP reduction, left to right across the top row and then right to left across the bottom row. Each panel is a real VPR placement: saturated tiles are occupied, pale tiles are provisioned but unused. Early episodes, still close to random exploration, overshoot badly in both fabric size and ADP. Later episodes converge on a compact, exactly-sized fabric (bottom left)}{figure.caption.8}{}}
